{"unit_id":"ttmouse__dsh-model-picker#card-zh","repo":"ttmouse/dsh-model-picker","commit":"6d7881aef2c2c29f8396667dbe956229488968d5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-picker 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的模型选择插件，接管输入框中的模型选择区域，并将模型选择与推理强度选择拆成两个弹出面板。用户可以按模型或供应商搜索、筛选供应商、查看收藏和最近使用的路由，也可查看模型上下文长度、图像输入标记及本地网关提供的账户额度。插件还提供备用模型队列与连通状态相关的管理界面，适合需要在多个模型和供应商之间快速切换的 DSH 网页用户。额度信息依赖本机 Magpie 网关；不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-6","lib/client.js:2677-2745","lib/host.js:396-460"]}
{"unit_id":"ttmouse__dsh-model-picker#card-en","repo":"ttmouse/dsh-model-picker","commit":"6d7881aef2c2c29f8396667dbe956229488968d5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-model-picker adds model search and a separate reasoning-effort picker to the DSH web composer. Users can revisit favorites and recent routes, view context and image-input details, and manage fallback routes with local quota data. Quotas use a local Magpie gateway; no extra API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-6","lib/client.js:2677-2745","lib/host.js:396-460"]}
